  "timeoutRetry": "Request timed out. Please try again.",

  "consentText":"Privacy Policy – ASConnect Application\n\n1) Identity of the Data Controller\nThe data collected in the ASConnect application is processed by AngelmanAnalytics as data controller.\nFor any questions regarding your data or the exercise of your rights, you can contact us at: contact@angelmananalytics.org.\n____________________________________________\n2) Purposes of Processing\nThe data processing carried out via the application pursues the following purposes:\no Creation and management of your user account for named access to the ASConnect application;\no Use of geolocation features in order to view:\no Profiles of concerned persons, according to different criteria (geographical distance, genotype, age range);\no Improvement of the service and personalization of the user experience, including the possibility for the user.\no Extraction of data that does not allow identification of individuals for statistical purposes: number of people with Angelman syndrome, age distribution...\n____________________________________________\n3) Categories of Data Collected\nThe following data may be collected:\n• Identification data:\no gender, last name, first name, email address, password, photo,\no security question and answer (in case of forgotten password);\n• Sensitive data:\no genotype, location.\nThe legal basis for this processing is the explicit and informed consent of the user.\n____________________________________________\n4) Data Retention Period\nData is kept for the entire duration of account use, then deleted within a maximum of 12 months after the last activity.\nThe user may at any time exercise their right to erasure directly within the application via the menu:\nPrivacy Policy → Right to erasure.\n____________________________________________\n5) Data Recipients and Hosting\nData is securely hosted on PythonAnywhere servers.\nData is stored within the European Union.\n(For more information on the host's data protection policy, see https://www.pythonanywhere.com/privacy/.)\nThe Web application is hosted by O2Switch in France, see https://www.o2switch.fr/du-rgpd.pdf.\n____________________________________________\n6) Users' Rights\nIn accordance with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR), users have the following rights:\no Right of access, rectification and erasure (“right to be forgotten”) — directly via their profile or the Privacy Policy → Right to erasure menu;\no Right to object, data portability and restriction of processing;\no Right to withdraw consent at any time.\nTo exercise these rights (other than the right to erasure accessible from the application), you may send an email to contact@angelmananalytics.org.\n____________________________________________\n7) Security and Confidentiality\nAll data is encrypted during storage and transmission.\nPasswords are hashed according to security best practices, and all communications with the service are carried out via HTTPS protocol.\n____________________________________________\n8) Explicit Consent\nRegistration in the ASConnect application requires the explicit and informed consent of the user for the processing described in section 2.\nThe user may withdraw this consent at any time via account settings or by direct contact at contact@angelmananalytics.org.\n____________________________________________\n9) Rules for Proper Use of Exchanged Messages\no Do not post attacks or negative comments about groups. Any comment intended to harass, denigrate, threaten or abuse a person will be removed.\no Be kind and courteous. We are all involved in creating a positive, informative and respectful environment. Healthy debates are natural, but kindness is required.\no No disrespectful comments. Bullying in any form is not allowed and degrading comments are not tolerated. Do not post blasphemous, defamatory, offensive or violent statements.\no The sharing of advice should not be perceived as medical recommendations.\no No advertising.\no Failure to comply with the rules may lead the administrator to delete a profile.",
  
